WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.950
Overdrive Adamant Flame launches Ryu.

2
00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:01.650
The forward-punch follow-up extends the launch.

3
00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:02.250
Crouching heavy punch catches the falling opponent.

4
00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:03.250
Light Gou Hadoken holds the corner juggle.

5
00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:04.450
Heavy Tatsu continues the airborne juggle.

6
00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:04.850
Ryu lands after the juggle ender.
